{"Data race on shared MetricsMiddleware.next field - NewMetricsMiddleware creates a single *MetricsMiddleware instance and the returned ClientMiddlewareFunc closure sets imw.next = next each time it is called, causing concurrent requests to write to imw.next from different goroutines while other goroutines read it in QueryData/CallResource/etc, which is a data race detectable by Go's -race detector and constitutes undefined behavior": 0.18187160789966583}